# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
# This supports shell glob patterns, relative path patterns, and
# patterns with ** set to match zero or more directories.
# For more information, see:
#   https://helm.sh/docs/chart_template_guide/helm_ignore_file/
#
.git/
.gitignore
.bzr/
.bzrignore
.hg/
.hgignore
.svn/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.orig
